  "title": "Topos: Agent swarms for formal verification | Y Combinator",
  "text": "Home\u203aCompanies\u203aTopos\n\nTopos\n\nAgent swarms for formal verification\n\nFall 2026\n\nActive\n\nSwarm AI\nAI\nSan Francisco\n\n\u00a0https://www.toposlab.com\n\nAgent swarms for formal verification\nTopos is a neolab founded by two Harvard math dropouts, building agent swarms to bring the rigor and verifiability of mathematics to other fields. Starting in biology, we\u2019re optimizing how agents communicate, formalize problems, and verify each other\u2019s reasoning.\n\nActive Founders\n\nRyan Min June ShinFounder/CEO\nex harvard math\nformer world-record holding powerlifter.\n\nRyan Min June ShinFounder/CEO\n\nex harvard math\nformer world-record holding powerlifter.\n\nSohum SukhatankarFounder/CTO\nex harvard math\nnational spelling bee champion\n\nSohum SukhatankarFounder/CTO\n\nex harvard math\nnational spelling bee champion\n\nTopos\n\nFounded:2026\nBatch:Fall 2026\nTeam Size:2\nStatus:\nActive\nLocation:San Francisco\nPrimary Partner:Charlie Warren",
